r refine the distractor options so that they are more subtly incorrect, thereby deepening the challenge for students without making the question overly obscure. Additionally, more explicit tie-ins to the core concept of textual analysis within the passage could enhance the clarity of why the correct answer is superior."", ""difficulty_feedback"": ""The question matches its labeled medium difficulty well. It requires moderate, multi-step reasoning since students must integrate the context of NFTs and standard ideas of value with the function of the underlined sentence. The passage is appropriately complex without being overwhelming. To further reinforce its medium difficulty level, consider ensuring that the distractor options include more elements that are partially correct or appear plausible at a superficial reading, without compromising the clear textual support for the correct answer.""}"
