2025-05-20 23:51:38,"{""skill"": ""Main Idea"", ""difficulty"": ""Easy"", ""question"": ""The following text is adapted from a brief account discussing how Japanese animation (anime) and comics (manga) have influenced Western media:\n\nIn the past few decades, fans around the world have embraced anime and manga for their vibrant art style and engaging storylines. Western filmmakers, television producers, and illustrators have frequently borrowed techniques such as serialized plots and expressive character designs from these Japanese art forms, resulting in new creative directions. As the worldwide popularity of anime and manga grows, more Western audiences and creators are discovering the potential for innovative storytelling born from cross-cultural exchanges.\n\nWhich choice best states the main idea of the text?"", ""choices"": [""A. Japanese animation and comics have had a strong influence on Western media, encouraging fresh ideas and collaborative storytelling approaches."", ""B. Fans around the world enjoy anime and manga because they accurately represent historical cultural practices in Japan."", ""C. Western creators have largely avoided elements of anime and manga due to significant cultural differences."", ""D. The popularity of anime and manga is limited to a small minority of viewers within Western countries.""], ""answer"": ""A"", ""explanation"": ""Choice A is correct because the text highlights how anime and manga have introduced new storytelling strategies, appealing to Western audiences and artists and inspiring fresh creative approaches. By focusing on the enthusiasm for these Japanese art forms and their influence on filmmaking, television, and illustration, the passage’s main idea is that anime and manga helped shape Western media in significant ways.\nChoice B is incorrect because the text does not focus on historical cultural practices. Choice C is incorrect because the text suggests the opposite: Western creators often adopt methods from anime and manga. Choice D is incorrect because the text states anime and manga have achieved widespread popularity, not just limited appeal."", ""topic"": ""The cultural impact of anime and manga on Western storytelling and media""}",Main Idea,Easy,"The following text is adapted from a brief account discussing how Japanese animation (anime) and comics (manga) have influenced Western media:

