D. 100",B,"The problem asks for the number of tickets sold such that the total payment to the band equals $500.\
\
\( \text{Step 1: Define the variable. Let } x \text{ be the number of tickets sold. The total payment is given as } 200 + 5x. \)\
\
\( \text{Step 2: Set up an equation representing the total payment.}\)\
\(200 + 5x = 500\)\
\
\( \text{Step 3: Solve for } x: \)\
