hes and deluxe benches to meet a client's needs. The workshop must produce at least 10 standard benches. The combined total of standard and deluxe benches cannot exceed 50. The workshop has at most 240 hours to build these benches, where each standard bench requires 4 hours to construct and each deluxe bench requires 8 hours. The workshop's material budget is $3,000, where each standard bench costs $25 in materials and each deluxe bench costs $70.\n\nWhat is the maximum number of deluxe benches that the workshop can produce while meeting all these constraints?","A) 23
