There are just two minor improvements needed:

1. Answer Choice Formatting – The answer options currently use a period (e.g., “A. 26”). To adhere to the SAT style guidelines (as in the examples, which show “A) …”), change the answer choices to use a closing parenthesis. For example, change “A. 26” to “A) 26”.

